    "finalName": "",
    "description": "You may treat <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Talents\" title=\"Talents\">Talents</a> from the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber_Combat_Talent_Tree\" title=\"Lightsaber Combat Talent Tree\">Lightsaber Combat Talent Tree</a> as <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Talents\" title=\"Force Talents\">Force Talents</a>.&nbsp;Additionally, the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vibroshield\" title=\"Vibroshield\">Vibroshield</a> satisfies the requirement for an activated <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> for any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Talent\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Talent\">Force Talent</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a>.<br><br>If you create your own <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vibroshield\" title=\"Vibroshield\">Vibroshield</a> (see <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Build_Object\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Build Object\">Build Object</a>), you are considered to be behind <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Improved_Cover\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Improved Cover\">Improved Cover</a> instead of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cover\" title=\"Cover\">Cover</a> when using the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fight_Defensively\" title=\"Fight Defensively\">Fight Defensively</a> Action.",
